  "released": "2026-10-17",
  "notes": [
    "Keep running with the lid closed: your site keeps answering while your laptop's lid is closed. Turn it on during setup, in Settings → General → This computer, or with <command> awake on.",
    "On a Mac, it asks for your password once (in the Mac's own dialog), because only an administrator can stop a Mac from sleeping when its lid closes. While it's on, the Mac doesn't sleep at all, so plug it in when you can.",
    "On Windows, closing the lid does nothing while it's on, and the computer stays awake while the program runs. No administrator rights needed.",
    "A computer that's turned off still can't answer: Claude Code runs on it."
  ],
